{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20849","headline":"河南府试十二月乐词 十月 · 李贺","name":"河南府试十二月乐词 十月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉壶银箭稍难倾，釭花夜笑凝幽明。\n碎霜斜舞上罗幕，烛龙两行照飞阁。\n珠帷怨卧不成眠，金凤刺衣着体寒，长眉对月鬬弯环。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}